# Testing

Every behavior change requires a test that would fail without the change.

- Name tests after behavior, not implementation
- Cover happy path and one meaningful edge case when relevant
- Do not test trivial getters or framework boilerplate
- Run the narrowest test command that covers your change before finishing
- For Go: `make test` or `go test ./internal/... -v`
